nk the absence carries little weight.\",\"frond-colour-range: the mid-to-deep green of the rendered leaflets sits inside the range spanned by reference-0 (deep green) and reference-1/2 (grey-glaucous); no finding either way.\",\"trunk-lean-and-curve is recorded in the inventory as variation spanning a strong S-curve (reference-0) to vertical (reference-1/2); the render's defect is not lean but a localised wavy jog with taper, which the owner has explicitly ruled out regardless of that variation band.\",\"The P-BASE cell was requested at close range for a trait the generator does not yet express; the framing delivered makes even the drawn smooth surface unassessable.\",\"Relative to any earlier state, the crown now reads as a single apical rosette on an unbranched stem, but that is not absolute readiness against the reference-only inventory.\"],\"findings\":[{\"observation\":\"Crown is a flat radial starburst of short straight fronds with no arching and no fronds drooping below the crown base, in both seeds.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"render-0\",\"render-1\",\"render-2\",\"reference-0\",\"reference-1\"],\"impact\":\"blocker\",\"uncertain\":false,\"causal_hypothesis\":\"Consistent with frond length and leaflet size dials being set far below the reference, and with no gravity-driven droop applied to older fronds; the mechanism is not established by the images.\"},{\"observation\":\"Leaflets are sparse short ticks on a visible bare rachis rather than a dense stiff blade.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"render-2\",\"reference-1\",\"reference-2\"],\"impact\":\"blocker\",\"uncertain\":false,\"causal_hypothesis\":\"Consistent with the owner's reading that leaflet size is a primary dial; not established.\"},{\"observation\":\"Trunk shows a lateral kink below the crown and a pronounced base-to-apex taper.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"render-0\",\"render-1\",\"render-2\",\"reference-0\",\"reference-1\",\"reference-2\"],\"impact\":\"blocker\",\"uncertain\":false,\"causal_hypothesis\":\"The host note